B.cQt=new A.J("love","Deep riddle #963 \u2014 I grow when given away in romance yet shrink when hoarded in silence. What am I?","Affection")
B.cNy=new A.J("love","[Set 32] I bind no rope yet hold two souls tighter than chains. What am I?","A vow")
B.cOs=new A.J("love","Challenge 965: Seen in eyes before spoken on lips; I arrive first at every true meeting. What am I?","Recognition")
B.cHz=new A.J("bible","Deep riddle #966 \u2014 I swallowed a man yet could not digest his prayer; I returned him on the third dawn. What am I? (Think carefully.)","The great fish")
